	FPPPCS			/0=SET FPP P.C. IN PARAMETER TABLE.
	FPPDV0			/1=SET DIVIDE BY 0 EXIT.
	FPPOVR			/2=SET EXPONENT OVERFLOW EXIT.
	FPPUND			/3=SET EXPONENT UNDERFLOW EXIT.
	FPPFRO			/4=SET FRACTION OVERFLOW EXIT.
	FPPTRP			/5=SET INSTRUCTION TRAP EXIT  [EXCEPT TRAP 7].
	FPPEXT			/6=SET FPP EXIT EXIT [THE COMMONLY USED CONDITION.]
	FPPIOT			/7=SET FPP IOT EXIT.
	FPPSRT			/10=START FPP RUNNING.
	FPPCLR			/11=CLEAR FPP AND OWN I-O SYSTEM.
	FPPTTY			/12=SET FPP CHARACTER RECEIVED EXIT.
	FPPFAL			/13=SET FPP FAIL TO START EXIT.
