FPPSRT,	TAD	FPPTAB		/PREPARE TO START FPP RUNNING.
	FPCOM			/LOAD COMMAND REGISTER NOW.
	CLA			/CLEAR AC BECAUSE OF FEEBLE CONTROLLER.
	TAD	(FPPTAB+1	/GET ADDRESS OF ACTIVE PARAMETER TABLE.
	FPST			/START FPP RUNNING.
	SKP CLA			/IT DIDN T START. CLEAR AC BECAUSE OF FEBBLENESS.
	JMP	FPPKNO		/IT DID. EXIT THIS WAY BECAUSE OF FEEBLE CONTROLLER.
	JMS I	FPPLER		/FPP FAILED TO START. TAKE FAILING EXIT.
	CLA			/HE RETURNED. CLEAR AC TO BE SURE.
	JMP	FPPSRT		/AND RETRY NOW.
